@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam defaultFontName "Malgun Gothic"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #526AA5
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #526AA5
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ParticipantBorderColor #526AA5
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF3FB
  ActorBorderColor #526AA5
  ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}

actor "사용자" as User
participant "Flutter 앱" as App
participant "Flask API" as API
database "MySQL·이미지" as DB

User -> App : 홈에서 ‘재고 확인’ 선택
App -> API : GET /inventory?fridge_id
API -> DB : fridge_items 조회
DB --> API : 재료명·수량·상태·이미지 경로
API --> App : InventoryItem 목록
App --> User : 전체·정상·확인 필요 카드 표시
User -> App : 확인 필요 재료 선택
App -> API : GET /inventory/{id}
API -> DB : 상세 조회
DB --> API : AI 추정값·메모·수정 시각
API --> App : 상세 데이터
App --> User : 수정·저장·삭제 화면 표시
@enduml
